--:WriteSBMCharacterObject|
  -->LoadSpellBookModData|
  --&SBMCharObject|!$!!q!theme!q!:!q![&tmpChosen_Attr]!q!,!q!uiTheme!q!:!q![&UITheme_Attr]!q!,!q!slotStyle!q!:!q![&SlotStyleKey_Attr]!q!,!q!preparedOnly!q!:!q![&PrepToggle_Attr]!q!,!q!descriptionWhisper!q!:!q![&DescWhisperMode]!q!,!q!spellColor!q!:!q![&SpellColor_Attr]!q!,!q!iconColor!q!:!q![&IconColor_Attr]!q!,!q!actionToggle!q!:!q![&ActionToggle_Attr]!q!,!q!bonusToggle!q!:!q![&BonusToggle_Attr]!q!,!q!reactionToggle!q!:!q![&ReactionToggle_Attr]!q!,!q!actionColor!q!:!q![&ActionColor_Attr]!q!,!q!bonusColor!q!:!q![&BonusColor_Attr]!q!,!q!reactionColor!q!:!q![&ReactionColor_Attr]!q!!%!
